    "dress": "old-worker",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-worker_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひめの",
    "text": "「追いかけないと……。あぁでも、店長さんは休憩中っぽい。店員、わたししかいないなあ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 43,
    "dress": "old-worker",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-worker_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひめの",
    "text": "「う～ん、お店を空っぽにするわけにもいかないなあ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひめの",
    "text": "「生徒会長さんなら、後で気づいて本を返しにきてくれるだろうけどお？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 43,
    "dress": "old-worker",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-worker_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひめの",
    "text": "「困ったなあ。どうしよう、部長に相談しよっかなあ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 43,
    "dress": "old-worker",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-worker_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひめの",
    "text": "「でも生徒会長さん、いったい何の本を持ってっちゃったんだろお？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひめの",
    "text": "「あの慌てぶりからいって……もしや、えっちな本？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 43,
    "dress": "old-worker",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-worker_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひめの",
    "text": "「いや、うちのお店にはそういう本は置いてないしなあ。何なんだろお、いったい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 43,
    "dress": "old-worker",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-worker_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひめの",
    "text": "「たしか、このへんのコーナーに並んでる本は……。あっ、本が抜けてるところがある。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひめの",
    "text": "「あそこの本を、持って行っちゃったのかなあ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 43,
    "dress": "old-worker",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-worker_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひめの",
    "text": "「どういう本だろ、すごい気になる。高い位置にあるなあ。背伸びして、よいしょお……☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「いやぁ、すっげぇなぁ。お店の数がおおすぎて、クラクラしでぐるだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「どうしよっがな、どのお店で働こうがな……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「転校生しゃんは、どんなお店で働くのがいいと思う？　おら、転校生しゃんの意見が聞いてみてぇだ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「おらの特技を活かすなら、ダンス教室とが……。いやでも、資格とかいるんだろうなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「あんまり、アイドルとは関係ねぇ仕事をしたい気もするし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「でも、おら他に特技とがねぇしなぁ。アイドルのお仕事だげで汲々としでるがら、いつも。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「もっと趣味とか、スキルとか、増やさねぇとなぁ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「アイドルになる前は、島でお父の船の手伝いとがしてだげどなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「趣味も、ただのテレビ好きのアイドルオタク……みてぇなもんだったし。う～ん、う～ん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「えへ。楽しいだ、いろいろ考えちまうなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「おらアイドルにならなかっだら、つばさしゃんに見つけてもらわなかっだら、どんな人生を歩んでたんだろ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「きっと。島で暮らす他のみんなと、ふつうの女の子と同じように……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「漁業をしでたかなぁ、あるいは早く結婚して主婦になっちまったのかなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「それはそれで、幸せだったのかもしれねぇげど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「おらはもう、むかし憧れてた『テレビの向こう側』にきちまったんだよなぁ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「誰もがこれる場所じゃねぇ、おらだって、つばさしゃんと出会わなけりゃ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「だからここで、夢のなかみてぇなこの場所で踏んばらなくちゃな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「たとえ、どんな苦しくて哀しいこどがあっでも。つばさしゃんから見捨てられないかぎり、おらは……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「んあ、さっきから魚屋さんを探してるんだげど。ねぇよな。お洒落なショッピングモールだしなぁ、ここ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「フードコートのほうへ行けば、お魚がメインの食べ物屋さんとがあるかなぁ？」"
  },
